k(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;occupancyMap: Table mapping seat column (A, B, C...) and occupancy of the current row to the time it takes for a passager to take their seat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
